<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-001-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.164314" lon="-120.843179"><name>SC26-001-A</name><cmt>SC26-001</cmt><desc>Southern rocky rise Raised, rough bedrock within a deeper rocky complex. Terrain A 88/100; not catch probability. Center 140 ft; nearby 135–184 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional point-specific flag from this screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-014</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 175-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.1637523368119" lon="-120.8445659503411"/><trkpt lat="35.16375963720124" lon="-120.84497612175778"/><trkpt lat="35.16419346096824" lon="-120.84509409119276"/><trkpt lat="35.16465516715278" lon="-120.84505424301285"/><trkpt lat="35.16534079832673" lon="-120.84463697448844"/><trkpt lat="35.16572081165221" lon="-120.84404748485143"/><trkpt lat="35.16588664731975" lon="-120.84332576998659"/><trkpt lat="35.16581305724579" lon="-120.84258170984423"/><trkpt lat="35.16551124566024" lon="-120.8419285867546"/><trkpt lat="35.165027162890624" lon="-120.84146583575294"/><trkpt lat="35.164434508523286" lon="-120.84126390475942"/><trkpt lat="35.163823509919375" lon="-120.84135353053283"/><trkpt lat="35.16328718526921" lon="-120.84172106244385"/><trkpt lat="35.16290718288971" lon="-120.84231054412595"/><trkpt lat="35.162815584931145" lon="-120.84258658832579"/